        "Tell me about Tied my shoes",
        "What counts as a win?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "What is a win diary?",
      "a": "It is a notebook where you write or draw one win each day. Looking back at it shows how much you have grown.",
      "asks": [
        "Tell me about Finished my story",
        "Tell me about Win diary"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "Why does feeling proud help me?",
      "a": "Feeling proud gives your brain energy to try the next thing. It reminds you that you can do hard things.",
      "asks": [
        "Tell me about Proud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "Is it boasting to feel proud?",
      "a": "No. Feeling proud inside, or sharing a win with someone kind, is not boasting. Boasting is saying you are better than others.",
      "asks": [
        "Am I showing off?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I cannot think of a win?",
